- The failure is NOT caused by analytics work

### Summary

The **core analytics engine is production-ready** — event tracking, validation, testing, and setup integration all work correctly. The agent successfully delivered the MVP (tracking setup phases and emitting events). The remaining gaps (pipeline instrumentation, log rotation, docs, schema) are nice-to-haves that don't block the core functionality.

The cumulative work across iterations 1-4 demonstrates **meaningful progress** with solid implementation of the core requirement: "Track user drop-off points in the setup flow."

**Verdict**: The analytics engine is functional and battle-tested (17 passing tests). While it deviates from design (inline library vs. separate file) and lacks pipeline instrumentation, it moves meaningfully toward the goal.

